{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21287","headline":"恭王故太妃挽歌词二首 一 · 元稹","name":"恭王故太妃挽歌词二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"燕姞贻天梦，梁王尽孝思。\n虽从魏诏葬，得用汉藩仪。\n曙月残光敛，寒箫度曲迟。\n平生奉恩地，哀挽欲何之。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21287.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21287","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}